10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=774xcmHFDKoQ7kNvwGPFOM5&_nc_oc=Adq2RZjDYrbYvg9WRES8iP5oCq3jmgCeTSHu54l1G7YthDoqSP-zfm5pB3gLzSCdehs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7LDNzYT2cEY5hFb1Pz9HdHrmr60mrJhWF6Fg-_Cd6inA&oe=6A145BCC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CkTPGOoCIDIQ7kNvwFoF1G_&_nc_oc=AdphXbUgh5DE2ZWvJPrpqNKDFs0OCL3ug9C1Kotx8KYrCnvC6nxdfKESv9Q4BRTvFDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4rrr_CrijXbucQl_O2uHvx2-zwr6InSQw-071Sj3h-WA&oe=6A146CBC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lTLdjw8DMpUQ7kNvwGy4rAj&_nc_oc=Adp89H8JBsjWN_mH7D7TMewb6qb0vxsj3Y2gD-d-DarQuUkP3QeyLrLMAQ7RA2kbovk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6LSd-ZYGuf2JNLe7l6Kg1M5vG9_qf8HRtCpl7CQowunQ&oe=6A144BAB"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore